      },
      "notes": [
        {
          "label": "q in the result of lens 0.0->1.0 divides by input.d, whose range [-5, 5] includes 0, though 0 may not be an instance; bound the divisor away from 0 (>0 or <0)"
        },
        {
          "label": "a lens must be total: every instance of schema 0.0 must translate to an instance of schema 1.0 (totality rule unknown-divisor)"
        }
